  m_Name: GItem_SeedPlanter
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: VoxelEngine::VoxelEngine.GridSystem.GridBlockItem
  itemId: gitem_seedplanter
  displayName: Grid Seed Planter
  description: Compact ship-mounted single-crop hydroponic planter. Grows one crop
    pod at low power (20 W), drawing piped water from connected grid liquid tanks
    (or a hand canister) in a breathable room or world. Automatically plants seeds
    from its bin, keeps one seed to self-replant, and pushes ripe harvests into connected
    grid cargo.
